					<description><![CDATA[<p>Based on Aliénor's “Fluorescence to measure light intensity” paper, we developed a practical resource to help microscopy users quantify illumination at the sample, including spatial distribution and wavelength-dependent intensity.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://csl.sony.fr/news/fluorescence-to-measure-light-intensity-a-protocol/">Fluorescence to measure light intensity, a protocol</a> appeared first on <a href="https://csl.sony.fr">Sony CSL - Paris</a>.</p>
]]></description>
